                        "sense_id": "d59bfdb0-eeb7-3498-8c63-1b3098e725ed",
                        "entry_id": "7393501e-f58a-39ba-9168-ee217dbbcccf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "feierliches Rühmen Gottes, meist am Gebetsende"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "40425a60-4930-4f90-877b-87cb5c757aba",
                                "sense_id": "d59bfdb0-eeb7-3498-8c63-1b3098e725ed",
                                "text": "Im Vaterunser findet sich das Wort „Amen“ als Doxologie."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ab18f659-78c0-4984-96ba-b917b0794c27",
                        "source_entry_id": "7393501e-f58a-39ba-9168-ee217dbbcccf",
                        "source_sense_id": "d59bfdb0-eeb7-3498-8c63-1b3098e725ed",
                        "source_sense_description": "Religion: feierliches Rühmen Gottes, meist am Gebetsende",
                        "target_lang_word": "doxology",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "doxology",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8afaec0c-f27e-33d7-a9eb-fb0fa62630c8",
                                        "entry_id": "108a43f5-3e36-3ee9-a301-5a1685610e68",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expression of praise to God, especially a short hymn sung as part of a Christian worship service."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fb14953-952f-481e-8916-cecd93a3ca9e",
                                                "sense_id": "8afaec0c-f27e-33d7-a9eb-fb0fa62630c8",
                                                "text": "The doxology or sacred hymn, which celebrates the glory of the Trinity, is susceptible of very nice, but material, inflections; and the substance of an orthodox, or an heretical, creed, may be expressed by the difference of a disjunctive, or a copulative, particle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3c6af54-2213-456a-a001-d87572ef7f69",
                                                "sense_id": "8afaec0c-f27e-33d7-a9eb-fb0fa62630c8",
                                                "text": "And when those defendants were remonstrated with, their captain snapped his fingers in the plaintiffs’ teeth, and assured them that by way of doxology to the deed he had done, he would now retain their line, harpoons, and boat, which had remained attached to the whale at the time of the seizure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a6e874d2-8ae7-4800-942b-8d5f5c14fb9f",
                        "source_entry_id": "7393501e-f58a-39ba-9168-ee217dbbcccf",
                        "source_sense_id": "d59bfdb0-eeb7-3498-8c63-1b3098e725ed",
                        "source_sense_description": "Religion: feierliches Rühmen Gottes, meist am Gebetsende",
                        "target_lang_word": "doxologie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "doxologie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f680de6f-7b4c-3a0d-b708-f2eaf97167fe",
                                        "entry_id": "6b96198f-a870-3c93-9229-3330a0038cd3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prière pour célébrer la grandeur et la majesté de Dieu. Dernière strophe d’une hymne, qui est relative à une glorification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "192a1222-8995-42cf-a7c5-d6ef2cd92755",
                                                "sense_id": "f680de6f-7b4c-3a0d-b708-f2eaf97167fe",
                                                "text": "Lors de cette messe bilingue, les prêtres utilisent, l’un en latin et l’autre en anglais, le même texte final de la doxologie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f96bcb7e-ddca-480c-b8a8-d08f34eb606c",
                                                "sense_id": "f680de6f-7b4c-3a0d-b708-f2eaf97167fe",
                                                "text": "Ce n’est donc que par une pastorale erronée que l’on peut faire chanter la doxologie par toute l’assemblée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bbebdcd2-6c2c-3a68-bdf4-f2e527624dc3",
                                        "entry_id": "6b96198f-a870-3c93-9229-3330a0038cd3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Énoncé d’une opinion généralement admise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
